            // P_1(x) = 1, P_2(x) = -x, P_3(x) = 2x^2 - 1 ...
            // the general recurrence relation for P_n is:
            // P_n(x) = (x^2+1) P_(n-1)'(x) - (2n-3) x P_(n-1)(x)
            // as per polynomial parity, we can store coefficients of both P_(n-1) and P_n in the same array
