     * Implements the formula: <pre>
     * <code> atan(z) = (i/2) log((i + z)/(i - z)) </code></pre></p>
     * <p>
     * Returns {@link Complex#NaN} if either real or imaginary part of the
     * input argument is <code>NaN</code> or infinite.</p>
